cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CFEDemands: estimation and computation of Constant Frisch Elasticity demand systems"
abstract: >-
  Tools for estimating and computing Constant Frisch Elasticity (CFE) demand
  systems.  The CFE demand system delivers demands that are linear in the
  logarithm of the marginal utility of expenditure, which makes estimation
  tractable in household panel data with unobserved heterogeneity and permits
  welfare and demand counterfactuals to be computed directly from estimated
  elasticities.  Distributed on PyPI as CFEDemands and imported as cfe.
